{"seq":2,"slug":"endpoints-and-routing","title":"端点与路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/networking-layer-architecture/endpoints-and-routing","wordCount":1777,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"端点与路由\">端点与路由</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>API 客户端需要知道「发什么请求」——哪个路径、什么方法、带什么参数、返回什么类型。把这些用裸字符串散落在调用处（<code>api.send(&quot;/users/\\(id)/posts&quot;)</code>）容易拼错、不类型安全、也不自文档。成熟的网络层用**类型化的端点（Endpoint）**描述每个 API——让每个 API 调用既类型安全又像一份自描述的接口清单。本节讲清端点与路由的设计——它让 API 调用从「拼字符串」变成「调类型化的方法」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>端点的本质是<strong>把「一个 API 请求」建模成一个自描述的值</strong>——它知道自己是什么请求，客户端只负责执行它：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Endpoint 值: path / method / queryItems / body&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;makeRequest(baseURL:)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;URLRequest&quot;]&#10;    D[&quot;客户端 APIClient&quot;] --&gt;|执行| C&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;认证 / 解码 / 错误: 怎么执行&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[&quot;请求是什么&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;职责分离: 端点描述请求, 客户端执行&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Endpoint 值: path / method / queryItems / body\"] --&gt; B[\"makeRequest(baseURL:)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"URLRequest\"]\n    D[\"客户端 APIClient\"] --&gt;|执行| C\n    D --&gt; E[\"认证 / 解码 / 错误: 怎么执行\"]\n    A --&gt; F[\"请求是什么\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"职责分离: 端点描述请求, 客户端执行\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>端点是值而非字符串</strong>：路径、方法、参数、body 都是类型化字段——拼错路径或方法在编译期或构造时就被约束，而非运行时 404。</li>\n<li><strong>各自负责构建</strong>：端点把自己变成 <code>URLRequest</code>（拼 URL、设方法、编码 body）——构建逻辑收敛，客户端不重复。</li>\n<li><strong>职责分离</strong>：端点回答「请求是什么」，客户端回答「怎么执行」（认证/解码/错误）——两件事分开，各自简单。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>「请求是什么」与「怎么执行」分离，是类型化网络层的基础——端点负责前者、客户端负责后者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用类型描述端点\">用类型描述端点</h2><p>把每个 API 端点建模成一个值——封装它的路径、方法、参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct Endpoint {&#10;    let path: String&#10;    let method: HTTPMethod        // enum: get, post, put, delete&#10;    var queryItems: [URLQueryItem] = []&#10;    var body: Encodable? = nil&#10;&#10;    func makeRequest(baseURL: URL) -&gt; URLRequest {&#10;        var components = URLComponents(url: baseURL.appendingPathComponent(path),&#10;                                       resolvingAgainstBaseURL: false)!&#10;        components.queryItems = queryItems.isEmpty ? nil : queryItems&#10;        var request = URLRequest(url: components.url!)&#10;        request.httpMethod = method.rawValue&#10;        if let body = body { request.httpBody = try? JSONEncoder().encode(body) }&#10;        return request&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> method: HTTPMethod        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// enum: get, post, put, delete</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryItems: [URLQueryItem] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: Encodable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">baseURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: URL) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> URLRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URLComponents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: baseURL.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">appendingPathComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                                       resolvingAgainstBaseURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        components.queryItems </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryItems.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isEmpty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryItems</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URLRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: components.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        request.httpMethod </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> method.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rawValue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body { request.httpBody </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSONEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(body) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>端点是值</strong>：每个 API 是一个 <code>Endpoint</code> 值——它知道自己的路径、方法、查询参数、请求体。客户端只负责执行任意端点。</li>\n<li><strong><code>makeRequest</code> 封装构建</strong>：端点负责把自己变成 <code>URLRequest</code>（拼 URL、设方法、编码 body）——构建逻辑收敛在一处，客户端不重复拼。</li>\n<li><strong>职责分离</strong>：端点描述「请求是什么」，客户端负责「怎么执行」（认证、解码、错误）——两者分工清晰。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把端点建模成自描述的值、各自负责构建 URLRequest，让「请求是什么」与「怎么执行」分离——这是类型化网络层的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"端点目录\">端点目录</h2><p>把所有端点集中定义成一个「目录」，让 API 自文档：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"extension Endpoint {&#10;    static var users: Endpoint {&#10;        Endpoint(path: &quot;/users&quot;, method: .get)&#10;    }&#10;    static func posts(forUser id: Int) -&gt; Endpoint {&#10;        Endpoint(path: &quot;/users/\\(id)/posts&quot;, method: .get)&#10;    }&#10;    static func createPost(_ post: NewPost) -&gt; Endpoint {&#10;        Endpoint(path: &quot;/posts&quot;, method: .post, body: post)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 调用：类型化、自文档、编译器检查&#10;let posts: [Post] = try await api.send(.posts(forUser: 42))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users: Endpoint {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/users\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .get)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> posts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Endpoint {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/users/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(id)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/posts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .get)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> post: NewPost) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Endpoint {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/posts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .post, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: post)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 调用：类型化、自文档、编译器检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posts: [Post] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> api.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>集中目录</strong>：把所有端点定义成静态属性/方法集中一处——这份目录就是<strong>应用所有 API 的清单</strong>，一眼看清后端有哪些接口。</li>\n<li><strong>参数化端点</strong>：需要参数的端点用静态方法（<code>posts(forUser:)</code>）——参数类型安全，拼路径在一处不会拼错。</li>\n<li><strong>调用即文档</strong>：调用处变成 <code>api.send(.posts(forUser: 42))</code>——读起来就是「取 42 号用户的帖子」，自描述、编译器检查参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>集中的端点目录把应用所有 API 变成一份类型安全、自文档的清单——调用处清晰、参数安全、新增/修改接口都在一处。</p>\n<p>两种端点形态的取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>调用写法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>非泛型端点</td>\n<td><code>let posts: [Post] = try await api.send(.posts(forUser: 42))</code></td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>调用处要写返回类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型端点 <code>Endpoint&lt;Response&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>let posts = try await api.send(.posts(forUser: 42))</code></td>\n<td>返回类型自动推断</td>\n<td>定义稍复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关联返回类型-进阶\">关联返回类型（进阶）</h2><p>更进一步，可以让端点<strong>携带它的返回类型</strong>，连解码类型都不必在调用处指定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct Endpoint&lt;Response: Decodable&gt; {&#10;    let path: String&#10;    let method: HTTPMethod&#10;    // ……&#10;}&#10;extension Endpoint {&#10;    static var users: Endpoint&lt;[User]&gt; { .init(path: &quot;/users&quot;, method: .get) }&#10;}&#10;// send 从端点推断返回类型，调用处更简洁&#10;let users = try await api.send(.users)   // 自动知道是 [User]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Decodable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> method: HTTPMethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ……</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users: Endpoint&#x3C;[User]> { .</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/users\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .get) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// send 从端点推断返回类型，调用处更简洁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> api.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.users)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动知道是 [User]</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>泛型端点</strong>：让 <code>Endpoint</code> 带上 <code>Response</code> 类型参数——端点自己声明「我返回 <code>[User]</code>」。</li>\n<li><strong>返回类型自动推断</strong>：<code>send</code> 从端点的 <code>Response</code> 推断返回类型——调用处不必写 <code>: [User]</code>，更简洁、更不会指定错类型。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡</strong>：泛型端点更优雅、更安全，但稍复杂——小项目用简单的非泛型端点也完全够用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>让端点携带返回类型，使解码类型也类型安全、调用处更简洁——这是端点设计的进阶形态，按项目复杂度选用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><p>设计端点与路由，几个实践要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>端点建模成值</strong>：每个 API 一个 <code>Endpoint</code>，封装路径/方法/参数/body——别在调用处拼裸字符串。</li>\n<li><strong>集中目录</strong>：所有端点定义在一处（extension 静态成员），形成 API 清单——便于查阅与维护。</li>\n<li><strong>参数化用方法</strong>：带参数的端点用静态方法、参数类型安全——避免手拼路径出错。</li>\n<li><strong>方法用枚举</strong>：HTTP 方法用 <code>enum</code>（get/post/...）而非字符串——避免拼错。</li>\n<li><strong>按需上泛型返回类型</strong>：项目复杂、API 多时让端点带 Response 类型；简单项目非泛型即可。</li>\n<li><strong>别在端点里做执行</strong>：端点只描述请求，执行/认证/解码留给客户端——保持职责分离。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>API 客户端需知道发什么请求，裸字符串散落易拼错、不类型安全、不自文档。类型化端点：每个 API 建模成 Endpoint 值（封装 path/method/queryItems/body）、makeRequest 封装构建 URLRequest（拼 URL/设方法/编码 body）、端点描述&quot;请求是什么&quot;客户端负责&quot;怎么执行&quot;（职责分离）。端点目录：所有端点定义成 extension 的静态属性/方法集中一处（应用所有 API 的清单一眼看清）、参数化端点用静态方法（posts(forUser:) 参数类型安全拼路径不出错）、调用变 api.send(.posts(forUser:42)) 自描述编译器检查。进阶：泛型端点 Endpoint<a href=\"response:decodable\">Response:Decodable</a> 携带返回类型（端点声明返回 [User]、send 自动推断、调用处不必写类型、更安全但稍复杂、小项目非泛型够用）。实践上端点建模成值、集中目录、参数化用方法、方法用枚举、按需上泛型返回类型、别在端点里做执行。掌握端点与路由让 API 调用从拼字符串变成调类型化方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>API 客户端需知道发什么请求（路径/方法/参数/返回类型），裸字符串散落调用处（api.send(&quot;/users/(id)/posts&quot;)）易拼错、不类型安全、不自文档。类型化端点把每个 API 建模成 Endpoint 值——封装 path/method/queryItems/body，makeRequest(baseURL:) 封装把自己变成 URLRequest（用 URLComponents 拼 URL、设 httpMethod、编码 httpBody），端点描述&quot;请求是什么&quot;、客户端负责&quot;怎么执行&quot;（认证/解码/错误），职责分离。端点目录：所有端点定义成 extension Endpoint 的静态属性（static var users）/方法（static func posts(forUser id:Int)）集中一处，这份目录就是应用所有 API 的清单（一眼看清后端接口），参数化端点用静态方法（参数类型安全、拼路径在一处不会错），调用变 api.send(.posts(forUser:42)) 自描述、编译器检查参数。进阶关联返回类型：泛型 Endpoint<a href=\"response:decodable\">Response:Decodable</a> 让端点携带返回类型（static var users:Endpoint&lt;[User]&gt;）、send 从端点 Response 推断返回类型（调用 let users = try await api.send(.users) 自动知是 [User]、不必写类型、不会指定错）、更优雅安全但稍复杂、小项目非泛型够用。实践：端点建模成值（别拼裸字符串）、集中目录形成 API 清单、参数化用方法、HTTP 方法用枚举避免拼错、按需上泛型返回类型、端点只描述请求别做执行（保持职责分离）。掌握端点与路由让 API 调用从拼字符串变成调类型化方法。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"端点与路由","id":"端点与路由"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用类型描述端点","id":"用类型描述端点"},{"level":2,"text":"端点目录","id":"端点目录"},{"level":2,"text":"关联返回类型（进阶）","id":"关联返回类型-进阶"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"API 客户端设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/networking-layer-architecture/api-client-design"},"next":{"title":"重试与韧性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/networking-layer-architecture/retry-and-resilience"}}